Package: box-desktop
Version: 13.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ZOOMRIYA <os@zoomriya.com>
Depends: zoomriya-agent, zoomriya-id, systemd, libpam-systemd, sway, python3, python3-gi,
 gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-webkit-6.0, pipewire, pipewire-bin, wireplumber, iso-codes, locales,
 fonts-noto-core, fonts-noto-cjk
Replaces: box-desktop-app, zoomriya-setup
Breaks: box-desktop-app, zoomriya-setup
Provides: box-desktop-app, zoomriya-setup
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Box Desktop, the admins' web desktop, and the box's first setup
 box-desktopd serves Box Desktop to browsers on the home network over
 HTTPS (TCP 7443), with ZOOMRIYA Connect's certificate or the box's own,
 and to the box's own screen, where box-desktop-screen shows it full
 screen. Admins sign in with the box's ZOOMRIYA ID; it asks
 zoomriya-agent for everything it shows or changes, from a fixed list, in
 the signed-in admin's name, and plays and records sound through PipeWire.
 Until the box is set up, its screen shows the first setup instead: the
 language, keyboard, network, region, time zone and the box's admin.
